    "$comment_acceptance": "The 0.60 / 0.15 floor never moves. acceptance_threshold is the level's own bar above it (thesis 4.5.4.2), raised only once the new brush from Dagat is in hand; after eases_after_declines declines in a row it falls by ease_step per decline to the floor. See SketchClient. Mayon: the last painting; the new brush asks the most.",
